            "description": "The TNFAIP3 p.Leu147Glnfs variant identified in Patient ID 507 has been shown to cause germline autoinflammatory disease due to A20 haploinsufficiency.^34 The patient here has a lymphoproliferative phenotype \u2026 Three patients with lymphoproliferation had mosaic variants in TNFAIP3 leading to premature termination and haploinsufficiency (Patient IDs 66, 99, and 507)."
